refentry.refsect1:
&reftitle.errors;
A ValueError is thrown if the value of servicename parameter is empty.
A Win32ServiceException is thrown on any other error, for example when the caller does not have administrative privileges.

  &reftitle.examples;



    A win32_exists_service example

     Creates the dummyphp service only if it does not already exist.



<?php
if (!win32_exists_service('dummyphp')) {
    win32_create_service([
        'service' => 'dummyphp',
        'display' => 'sample dummy PHP service',
        'params'  => __FILE__ . ' run',
    ]);
}
?>
